cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use QSAD in your research, please cite the paper below."
title: QSAD
abstract: >-
  QSAD is an end-to-end pipeline that bridges utility-scale superconducting
  QPU sampling with protein structure reconstruction: quantum sampling of the
  Miyazawa-Jernigan lattice Hamiltonian, bitstring decoding with a ten-term
  lattice energy decomposition, and energy-ranked Ca-to-all-atom
  reconstruction.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/qiqi-xingyi/QSAD"
# Concept DOI: always resolves to the latest archived version.
